{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `x1`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: moved the model-block deterministic computations of `sigma_sq`, `tau1_sq`, and `sum_sq_1` to occur after the prior sampling statements. In the original program these local initializers used parameters before their required SafeStan priors. The rewrite preserves the same posterior/log density. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N;
  vector[N] x1; // Complete observation
  vector[N] y1; // Complete observation
  vector[N] y2; // Incomplete observation

  int<lower=1> N_grid; // Number of grid points for quantifying functional behavior
  vector[N_grid] y_grid; // Grid points for quantifying functional behavior
}

parameters {
  real mu1;
  real<lower=0> tau1;
  real<lower=0> sigma;
}

model {
  real sigma_sq;
  real tau1_sq;
  real sum_sq_1;

  mu1 ~ normal(0, 3);
  tau1 ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma ~ normal(0, 1);

  sigma_sq = square(sigma);
  tau1_sq = square(tau1);
  sum_sq_1 = tau1_sq + sigma_sq;

  x1 ~ normal((y1 * tau1_sq + mu1 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_1,
              sqrt(tau1_sq * sigma_sq / sum_sq_1));
}

generated quantities {
  // Predict completion of second observation using
  // conditional variate model from first observation
  vector[N_grid] f_grid;  // Inferred functional behavior along covariate grid
  array[N_grid] real x2_pred_grid; // Predictive variate behavior along covariate grid

  array[N] real x2_pred;
  {
    real sigma_sq = square(sigma);
    real tau1_sq = square(tau1);
    real sum_sq_1 = tau1_sq + sigma_sq;

    f_grid = (y_grid * tau1_sq + mu1 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_1;

    x2_pred_grid = normal_rng((y_grid * tau1_sq + mu1 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_1,
                              sqrt(tau1_sq * sigma_sq / sum_sq_1));

    x2_pred = normal_rng((y2 * tau1_sq + mu1 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_1,
                         sqrt(tau1_sq * sigma_sq / sum_sq_1));
  }
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":2,"N_grid":4,"x1":[4.661338567121259,5.322682047175187],"y1":[3.6988380300390333,3.4324167948083715],"y2":[5.1403341028918215,6.396375051280816],"y_grid":[1.0,2.0,3.0,4.0]}","protected_variables":["x1"]}
